{"E:\\videos\\olc02\\wt\\vlog\\olc07\\voz\\b003_t5.wav": {"text": "So your grandpa ate fast and quiet, and he ate a lot. Those men burned 7,000 or 8,000 calories a day out there. Supper number one, pot beans with salt pork. Every camp in Minnesota had beans on the table nearly every day. Pinto or navy beans, a chunk of salt pork, an onion, cooked slow in a big kettle on the back of the range. If your grandpa worked the camps, he ate more beans than anything else in his life. The trick the good cooks knew was salt at the start and a hard boil for ten minutes and then just a whisper of a simmer for an hour and a half. The beans come out creamy, not hard, and the broth, what the old cooks called pot liquor, was never thrown out. It went over the beans and over the bread. Today, one pound of dry beans and a quarter pound of salt pork with an onion is about $3.40 for a pot that feeds eight, about 45 cents a bowl.", "words": [{"w": " So", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.16}, {"w": " your", "s": 0.16, "e": 0.34}, {"w": " grandpa", "s": 0.34, "e": 0.84}, {"w": " ate", "s": 0.84, "e": 1.24}, {"w": " fast", "s": 1.24, "e": 1.7}, {"w": " and", "s": 1.7, "e": 1.9}, {"w": " quiet,", "s": 1.9, "e": 2.7}, {"w": " and", "s": 2.7, "e": 2.82}, {"w": " he", "s": 2.82, "e": 2.94}, {"w": " ate", "s": 2.94, "e": 3.16}, {"w": " a", "s": 3.16, "e": 3.32}, {"w": " lot.", "s": 3.32, "e": 4.12}, {"w": " Those", "s": 4.18, "e": 4.4}, {"w": " men", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.76}, {"w": " burned", "s": 4.76, "e": 5.12}, {"w": " 7,000", "s": 5.12, "e": 5.54}, {"w": " or", "s": 5.54, "e": 5.66}, {"w": " 8,000", "s": 5.66, "e": 6.16}, {"w": " calories", "s": 6.16, "e": 6.72}, {"w": " a", "s": 6.72, "e": 7.06}, {"w": " day", "s": 7.06, "e": 7.26}, {"w": " out", "s": 7.26, "e": 7.54}, {"w": " there.", "s": 7.54, "e": 8.36}, {"w": " Supper", "s": 8.4, "e": 8.68}, {"w": " number", "s": 8.68, "e": 9.0}, {"w": " one,", "s": 9.0, "e": 9.84}, {"w": " pot", "s": 9.84, "e": 10.08}, {"w": " beans", "s": 10.08, "e": 10.4}, {"w": " wit